<p>Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)<br />
 <br />
Ho Mere laal kaha'n par<br />
Kaise Ji paayegi Madar<br />
Aa bhi jaa lout ke dilbar<br />
Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)</p>

<p>1. Kitne nazo'n se tujhe paala tha mere beta<br />
loriyaa'n deke sulaaya hai tujhe aye beta<br />
Sar tera bar sare naiza<br />
Jab se aaya mere beta<br />
roti hoon dil ko pakadkar<br />
Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)</p>

<p>2. Gham tera dil me samaane se samaata hi nahi<br />
Tu hua Nahr yaqee'n mujhko ye aata hi nahi<br />
Har bashar sonch raha hai<br />
Haaye kya iski qata hai<br />
Kyun chala teer e sitamgar<br />
Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)</p>

<p>3. Jab fida hogae sab yawar o nasir ban mein<br />
kehke labbaik mera Asghar(a.s) gaya tha ran me<br />
Hatho'n me apne pidar ke<br />
sab ko rulwadiya has ke<br />
kha gaya teer gale par<br />
Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)</p>

<p>4. Teghe Haider(a.s) se banaayi gayi teri turbat<br />
Tere baba pa thi aye beta wo kaisi gurbat<br />
Sath paani bhi nahi tha<br />
koi yawar bhi nahi tha<br />
tar kiya qabr ko rokar<br />
Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)</p>

<p>5. Ghar mere laal ka aye logo manaate rahiyo<br />
you'n hi gehwaara juluso'n me uthaate rahiyo<br />
Mere mazloom ka maatam<br />
<b>Asghari</b> karte raho tum<br />
Nouha besheer ka sunkar<br />
Haaye Asghar(a.s) Haaye Asghar(a.s)</p>

